{"resourceIdentifier":"4195","resourceName":"Anlu Aonong Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project","description":"Anlu Aonong Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) introduce animal waste management system (AWMS) to the two swine farms in Xundian Town, Anlu City, Hubei Province, China, which are owned by Hubei Aonong Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd. The project activity aims to treat the manure and wastewater from the 2 swine farms to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nThe project activity will reduce of GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater.","location":{"latitude":31.159510,"longitude":113.638980},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-15","endExclusive":"2023-04-15","endInclusive":"2023-04-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4195"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Aonong Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4195"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"140424"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24/04/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 10/09/2